Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I summoned Dark Magician Girl to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, you always were my top student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And even in my absence, I can see you've\Nbeen keeping up with your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many of them, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shackle Warrior, protect him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold back these spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You go to the underground\Nshrine and help our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.21,0:01:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Shadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, ready yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed\Nat home, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical orb, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's going to take\Nmore than just pointed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,hats and magic wands\Nto defeat my dear Val!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.31,0:02:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, spirits of Kull Elna, give my\Ncreatures some company, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like our problems have just\Nmultiplied yeah by three as you can see my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,dear pound has picked up a few new tricks\Nthanks to the support of my spirit friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Retaliate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, but not quite\Ngood enough Helical shockwaves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Farrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign is over, Farrow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll attack them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more Millennium Items, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, he wasn't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Although my spirit is sealed in stone,\NI shall continue to protect our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Mahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your devotion is an inspiration to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall have plenty of time to\Npraise Mahad for his efforts later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we have a villain to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A pharaoh is weak and time is short.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Replenish the life energy of our king!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guardians have interfered for the\Nlast time. Let's duel! No, wait, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,too dangerous without your millennium\Npuzzle leave bakura to us excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,idea that way i can acquire three more\Nmillennium items giving me a grand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,total of five i really must thank\Nyou for making this so easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacora, we the guardians of the Pharaoh\Nwill see to it that your plan ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The more, the merrier, as I always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, dear Bound, show these\Nfools the power of a shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardians, unite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Synchronize blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it lives! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We bombarded it from four\Ndifferent directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my dear Bound has some\Nadded support from the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark spirits of Kul\N'Elna, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And they despise your\Nkingdom as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as we remain in their\Nvillage, they'll be protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark spirits of\Nthis village are angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They blame me for what happened\Nhere all those years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,when their spirits were captured\Nto forge the Millennium Icons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did what was necessary,\Nand I stand by that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Agnodon, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be walking these streets\Nalone. Tell me, where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They have all gone to an underground\Ncavern to help the Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your key, it senses something.\NYou're right, it's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be quite a powerful force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall go investigate the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever my key is detecting\Nlies at the foot of these stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the dark energy growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Millennium Key, cast\Nyour light upon the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The tablet of Bakura's Dearbound?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything makes sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearbound must have been created by\Nthe evil spirits of this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was born out of their rage\Nand sealed in stone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we destroy this tablet,\NBakura's beast will be no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed jackal warrior, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me no choice, Shaddaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you stand in\Nthe way of my son's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attacks will never\Npenetrate my spirit shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.75,0:08:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're not going\Nto strike, then allow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Be abound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison Fang Chain Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think your elf will be\Nregenerating anyone's strength now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Isis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, all seven\NMillennium items will be mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing Zork the Dark One to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, he won't be defeated,\Nthanks to my newest servant, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Running from bad guys makes Bobasa hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm craving a juicy mango.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you said tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, those Creepazoids are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we're up here\Nand there down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, why haven't they come\Nafter us since the Pharaoh left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be focusing our energy on figuring\Nout how we can help the pharaoh win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want him to defeat Bakura\Njust like he did in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then we have to do our part, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's think, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:10:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time the pharaoh\Nsaved Egypt from destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,he mysteriously lost his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if, for some\Nreason, he did that on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting the\Npharaoh erased his own mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.51,0:10:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we never\Nthought of that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was right in front of\Nour faces and we missed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh must have been protecting some\Nsort of secret that only he knew about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.99,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you slow down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh didn't just forget his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He wiped his memory clean so no one could\Nbring back the evil that he locked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he was trying to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His real name!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His name had to stay a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you guys figure this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's name was removed\Nfrom the stone tablet, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have used it\Nas some sort of secret
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,password to lock that evil creature away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Bakura is trying to resurrect\Nthat monster to take over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So once Bakura gets hold of the\NMillennium Items and sets that thing free,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the pharaoh can only stop it\Nif he knows his real name! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So we gotta find it and tell the pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And unfortunately, we're\Nrunning out of time, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find that name!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and how are we gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh doesn't remember a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's not like we can look it up\Nin some ancient Egyptian phone book!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have an idea where we can start!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go back to the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,there's bound to be some records there\Nthat'll lead us in the right direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, time's running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to wait for the rest of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Duos, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't learned, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Diabao, give them a refresher course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That spirit shield is deflecting\Neven our most powerful blasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time we called upon the\Npower of the Millennium Scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster fusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and I must merge our creatures\Ntogether to take down Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Scale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuse our two spirits into one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The almighty Duos Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By combining this new dragon\Nwith the power of Mahad,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we have just tripled our strength
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that mutant of\Nyours is no match for my dear bound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, Duos, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them off, Helical Shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our two attack powers are equal. Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten that I have the\Nspirits of Kull Elna on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,making my dear pal unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to fry your dragon to\Na crisp diobount, end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Duos, or a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sword can't withstand those flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And like I always say, Seto, if you can't\Nstand the heat, get out of the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Kareem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame burst attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit shield is melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we penetrate his shield,\Nwe can defeat Deerbaugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but he won't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I still have plenty\Nof tricks up my golden sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He has another creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Very observant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I have another\NMillennium Item as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And without the scale, you no longer\Npossess the power of Monster Fusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Duo's Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back where we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Diabau, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Karim, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Help the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to try my new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Combine my two shadow creatures together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after decades of waiting, the\Nspirits of Kul 'Elna will get their revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare my friends! Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something I must do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My king!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the mighty Pharaoh has\Ncome to his senses and given
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Up. Now prepare to be trapped\Nfor eternity in the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When my father ordered the creation\Nof the Millennium Items Evil spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,needed to be captured to complete\Nthe spell And now they want revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,These dark spirits blame my\Nfather for trapping them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and they want me to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So I shall allow my soul to join them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and this grudge will be laid\Nto rest once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.39,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, absorb his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Infiltrate his very core!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant for this to happen, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, something strange is going\Non. What's this? Spirits of Kol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,elma it is not my son you want\Nit is me oh is that truly him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What now, Conan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:17:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's protecting his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear friend, it's been weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he just absorbed the evil spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens now, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,King Aknam Cannon will now lead these\Nwandering spirits to the realm of shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where they belong. But then he'll be\Ntrapped in there as well. That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to return to me at once How
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,can you allow this man\Nto lock you away again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Restore peace to our land, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike down his Deerbound while it's weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This will never work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.55,0:19:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your evil reign ends now! Farewell!
